  <data name="AhPremiumMethodNote.Text"><value>Premium = A price ÷ (H price × HKD/CNY) − 1. Both legs are prices actually paid — no adjustment — because a backward-adjusted series inflates recent prices, and two markets adjusted separately cannot be compared. The rate is a mid rate from a public quote service. Some services state the same gap the other way round — H against A, and negative — which is the reciprocal of this figure, not another price.</value></data>
