  <data name="FxCorridorMethodNote.Text"><value>Monthly bars, unadjusted — a currency has no dividend or split to adjust for. The corridor is the lowest low and the highest high **so far**, so it widens as the months pass and a pair at 100% is at the dearest it has been in the range, not at a limit. Coverage differs: USD/CNY reaches back to 2005, the other renminbi pairs to 2016.</value></data>
